 "text": "[slowly] Before Vair had a king... the mountain had a heart.\n\n[softly] It answered only to blood. And House Vaylor gave it theirs.\n\n[reverently] The castle remembers its rightful ruler. [quietly] So their people were taught.\n\n[gravely] Then war came to Vair.\n\n[uneasy] On the last night, the gates were sealed... [hushed] and the king went down to the heart.\n\n[whispers] Whatever he asked of it...\n\n[sorrowful] Kair Vair was torn... between two memories of itself.\n\n[mournfully] The kingdom became a story. Then a warning.\n\n[tenderly] Now, a daughter of the forgotten line... has come home.",
