 "transcript": "Before Verr had a king, the mountain had a heart. It answered only to blood, and House Valor gave it theirs. The castle remembers its rightful ruler, so their people were taught. Then war came to Verr. On the last night, the gates were sealed, and the king went down to the heart. Whatever he asked of it, Caer Verr was torn between two memories of itself. The kingdom became a story, then a warning. Now, a daughter of the forgotten line has come home.",
